	<key>PayloadDescription</key>
	<string>(09January2025v1) This profile enables several high quality &amp; reputable DNS resolvers over HTTPS &amp; TLS on all networks using Apple's native Encrypted DNS feature. Domains required for captive portals, connectivity checks, public Wi-Fis, routers, MMS, VVM, Wi-FI Calling, push notifications, etc. are excluded for compatibility. INFO FOR DNS SERVERS: Quad9 and DNS0 provide real-time malware protection. DNS0 (ZERO) provides hardened real-time malware protection. Mullvad (Base) provides Ad/Tracking/Limited Malware Protection. AdGuard (Public) provides Ad/Tracking Protection. Mullvad (Extended) provides Ad/Tracking/Limited Malware/Social Media Protection. Other servers are self-explanatory.</string>
	<key>PayloadDisplayName</key>
	<string>DNS</string>
